#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/bb9a4b57-90cf-40c0-bb16-dbeeab8fc885-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Sortie de la cellule de code précédente](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/bb9a4b57-90cf-40c0-bb16-dbeeab8fc885-0.avif)\n"

